            "pages": {
              "end": 29,
              "start": 29
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked whether there is any case where a benefit enjoyed by a party is taken away in a suit where that party is not a participant."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "419669bb092d1682221dbdfe72991eeeb401e5a6f44395cff5cda4cd6b6c38f9",
            "evidence_ids": [
