            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, justice Alito questioned whether comity is broader than the Tax Injunction Act and how to justify limiting comity to the Act\u2019s contours."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "419669bb092d1682221dbdfe72991eeeb401e5a6f44395cff5cda4cd6b6c38f9",
