          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, the case raises questions about whether existing federal abstention doctrines, such as the Pullman and Burford doctrines, are sufficient to justify federal abstention here."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "419669bb092d1682221dbdfe72991eeeb401e5a6f44395cff5cda4cd6b6c38f9",
