            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, the parties discuss the scope of the Tax Injunction Act and whether it limits the doctrine of comity."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Fitch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "419669bb092d1682221dbdfe72991eeeb401e5a6f44395cff5cda4cd6b6c38f9",
